        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DWD-BC712-US15, Satin Nickel Ball Catch</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese Satin Nickel ball catches are installed in the top, bottom and/or side of the door to hold them closed. An adjustable ball catch, the ball retaining cylinder threads into the catch face plate for 3/8\" of adjustment. Used in conjunction with dummy hardware. Supplied with strike and mounting hardware, made of solid brass.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-BC712US15-size.gif?v=1704354746\" width=\"600\" height=\"190\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Satin Nickel Ball Catch Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Door Ball Catch:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Adjustment Length: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Length: 2-1/8\" </li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Width: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Corner Type: Square</li>\r\n<li>Catch Face Plate Length: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Catch Face Plate Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Depth: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Nickel</b></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BC712-US15.pdf?v=1704262373\" target=\"new\"><b>DWD-BC712-US15 Specifications Diagram (PDF)</b></a>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
